ply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix ts errors in utils after API changed (#242)\n\n* feat: add player logic with README.md, SPECIFICATION.md\n\n* feat: add utils for converting api track(s) to player track format\n\n* refactor(player): explicit initialization and cleanup logic\n\n    - Removed side-effect initialization from `player-store.ts`.\n    - Added `initializePlayer` call to `main.tsx` entrypoint.\n    - implemented `cleanupPlayer` and event listener removal to prevent memory leaks and improve testability.\n\n* refactor(player): optimize hooks and fix infinite loop issues\n\n- Replace complex Zustand selectors with atomic state selection and `useMemo` to prevent unnecessary re-renders and potential infinite loops.\n- Fix `usePlayerKeyboardControls` using `useMemo` instead of `useEffect` for event listeners.\n- Extract queue navigation logic to reusable utility functions.\n- Add proper memoization for all hook return values\n\n* refactor: rename the file with the player track hooks\n\n* style(tanstack-query-zustand, player): format some files\n\n* docs(player): actualize README.md & SPECIFICATION.md\n\n* refactor(tracks-page): update player integration and track conversion\n\n* fix: adaptate Layout to a new player logic\n\n* fix(AudioPlayer): use a new player logic\n\n* fix(tanstack-query-zustand): take away build errors after merging","tree":{"sha":"a4a145918adc1ce578f1a4af088bfad5c3f24b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/it-incubator/musicfun-react-all-stacks/git/trees/a4a145918adc1ce578f1a4af088bfad5c3f24b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/it-incubator/musicfun-react-all-stacks/git/commits/cc2f5b04f59838a4e02d7dda0a7cd84836c1ea29","verification":{"payload":"tree a4a145918adc1ce578f1a4af088bfad5c3f24b0e\nparent dd5b57128ffabb82f8c204663edea56e8142c701\nauthor Svyatoslav <68824715+Svyat-1418@users.noreply.github.com> 1770233514 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770233514 +0300\n\nfix ts errors in utils after API changed (#242)\n\n* feat: add player logic with README.md, SPECIFICATION.md\n\n* feat: add utils for converting api track(s) to player track format\n\n* refactor(player): explicit initialization and cleanup logic\n\n    - Removed side-effect initialization from `player-store.ts`.\n    - Added `initializePlayer` call to `main.tsx` entrypoint.\n    - implemented `cleanupPlayer` and event listener removal to prevent memory leaks and improve testability.\n\n* refactor(player): optimize hooks and fix infinite loop issues\n\n- Replace complex Zustand selectors with atomic state selection and `useMemo` to prevent unnecessary re-renders and potential infinite loops.\n- Fix `usePlayerKeyboardControls` using `useMemo` instead of `useEffect` for event listeners.\n- Extract queue navigation logic to reusable utility functions.\n- Add proper memoization for all hook return values\n\n* refactor: rename the file with the player track hooks\n\n* style(tanstack-query-zustand, player): format some files\n\n* docs(player): actualize README.md & SPECIFICATION.md\n\n* refactor(tracks-page): update player integration and track conversion\n\n* fix: adaptate Layout to a new player logic\n\n* fix(AudioPlayer): use a new player logic\n\n* fix(tanstack-query-zustand): take away build errors after merging","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpg56qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMfkQAC1tPKBbe7O8iVv56VNSV5ym\ndNIr1ZBSz+G0JHXudUb5zWxG4mhVFWcagIIYWJmWvYkBA6RccI7OfKKsjEq420mi\nyDGak+98+XSjKd6h1/X7HQytYOy0+Tx/WfgwQu9zR2oUvV+o4t9KlN12jbBBekDX\n877OtPwZNPQME4o6HGOxx0DRRZR55pAeLakL/ArkN3txIlIcaBVNTvpZFsJZOC8p\n3Np/i2aJRvDxHo1Xr13dcDoAAlBZP/XLRjld77kcBfDdYQudGhhur1hTUCHOrEe+\nsZ+08EgNyAymvNlBG/IzJPnWC9sYIr9CtXEC+uOuHOAL3BXHVsc1NJNAJgG8qkpS\nh3Vu7fZgR1ES8m3XB8zzCBt2+RQ+beNLEO0+3/rr/Q0CNopyEVyvXKVpdkDO+pka\n2NslOUT+UcwpoPvRqJIIeViteaFCTsM/Pvjnj1VJA0UwGUD4AquUPWGcrVkFn8FY\nqXrT9bsciRj1NTdbvMrWAMvr27/oIa/HQcwfEfph6EO479rib4F0zk3Zg3N5eQWV\nfTKMI36SJDCuPzdfnjDN0kyAss1ufuzpubMp8zqt4kMewwy+5mvYQND