{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/molniagrom","id":155966302,"login":"molniagrom","node_id":"U_kgDOCUvbXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/molniagrom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/it-incubator/musicfun-react-all-stacks/commits/96e016b81c42157d613f588ecd2c79e559e2f6c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-30T17:17:00Z","email":"155966302+molniagrom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Molnia Grom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-30T17:17:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix to perfom build (version 2) (#227)\n\n* fix: Due to a minor error, the application crashed, but it has been fixed.\n\n* feat: start work to play the track\n\n* refactor: delete color line\n\n* feat: implement playback the track in the lower player, but it is not yet available on the track page.\n\n* feat: start working with local hooks and understanding the structure and architecture.\n\n* refactor: с помощью useState when clicking on the Play button, the track''s playing / pausing should work\n\n* feat: use usePlaybackState in ControlPanel\n\n* feat: replace isPlaying with useState on usePlaybackState\n\n* feat: centralize player control logic, but there is a bug with playing two tracks simultaneously, one local and one from the server.\n\n* fix: Fix a bug and rename IsTrackLoading (let it stay with me for now, I have plans for it).\n\n* feat: Working version: figure out how it works before committing!!!!!!!!!!!!!! And make it so that the track title, author, and image load when the button is pressed.\n\n* refactoring: Clean up unnecessary props\n\n* fix: fix loading title cover artist\n\n* fix: last bag with play track after page refresh\n\n* refactoring: clean component from comment\n\n* fix: fix bad to the optimistic update\n\n* fix(refactoring): The component was refactored to remove `useEffect`, which caused cascading renders. The state from the server is now calculated via `useMemo`, and the UI state is initialized only when the modal window is opened.\n\n* refactoring: implement data loading in ControlPanel via useLazyFetchTrackByIdQuery\n\n* refactoring: implement LazyQuery based on edits\n\n* fix: started fix infinity scroll in TracksPage component. HAVE ERRORS!!!\n\n* fix: rename endpoint in tracksApi.ts and insignificant changes in commonApi.types.ts\n\n* fix: trying to restore files to the state when everything worked\n\n* fix: seems like I''ve completely restored the endless wiring.\n\n* fix: fixed optimistic updates on the All Tracks page\n\n* chore: remove \"react-router-dom\": \"^7.11.0\" as amended\n\n* chore: remove \"@types/react-router-dom\": \"^7.11.0\" as amended\n\n* chore: add react-intersection-observer, without this dependency, there was an error in TracksPage on line 3.\n\n* refactor: remove unnecessary code\n\n* fix: eradicate cascade rendering to enable reaction buttons\n\n* fix: add missing props in AudioPlayer.stories.tsx","tree":{"sha":"47db17603db7e0be8d21b3594a4b96cf0193c1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/it-incubator/musicfun-react-all-stacks/git/trees/47db17603db7e0be8d21b3594a4b96cf0193c1e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/it-incubator/musicfun-react-all-stacks/git/commits/96e016b81c42157d613f588ecd2c79e559e2f6c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 47db17603db7e0be8d21b3594a4b96cf0193c1e6\nparent fa8eb88734caccfcc5336db9555fadf3bf837267\nauthor Molnia Grom <155966302+molniagrom@users.noreply.github.com> 1767115020 +0200\ncommitter Gi