ed reference ranges for vitals on the frontend. Specifically, it makes the following changes:\n\n- Adds patient age-based reference range fetching via the `conceptreferencerange` endpoint via the useVitalsConceptMetadata hook\n- Updates the vitals sign interpretation flagging to leverage the new age-based reference ranges\n- Modifies the FHIR observation handling to use the new age-based reference ranges","tree":{"sha":"71dcfc437238e9a0206a5bc2b91f4b12c3cf03a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digipaths-lk/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/git/trees/71dcfc437238e9a0206a5bc2b91f4b12c3cf03a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digipaths-lk/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/git/commits/ecb685031f80679b9b019c501c2dded48c057324","verification":{"payload":"tree 71dcfc437238e9a0206a5bc2b91f4b12c3cf03a6\nparent 243e8a39bdf3a48d61e7aa60ba47b4784603d71a\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1746012793 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746012793 +0300\n\n(feat) Use age-based reference ranges in vitals widget (#2406)\n\n(feat) Use age-based reference ranges for vitals\n\nThis PR implements age-based reference ranges for vitals on the frontend. Specifically, it makes the following changes:\n\n- Adds patient age-based reference range fetching via the `conceptreferencerange` endpoint via the useVitalsConceptMetadata hook\n- Updates the vitals sign interpretation flagging to leverage the new age-based reference ranges\n- Modifies the FHIR observation handling to use the new age-based reference ranges","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoEgp5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATNgQAJydBw40FTep+NcdBBFup0MS\n1w6HywcZktOkY6sqWlsQ9s9Ujhx3tzVcJ5X1QBf6vnNM93XWwGost/oDKJpL5kkp\nb1a+FmARjyM3vE0hPRbvsRPRK2PnFcRfmm1u+q6ClZW8mMRr2uC8rdRvEb/dvwva\nSECb8m/xzZM/Xvd7UwbUKn+eXjU5nuyL6yI30zBAVw4EmgTLDu1rK7LwivJ1NKOS\nEiH5F6qWevUomqcFcYZkj4uT6tndY4szAycbNd11sv8kbD2F0hzjyVop4q10W7Pr\ni9vgIpJf9SPVw3McWhq46w80Ge+h0G1On+L2fH2juziKsKDUhxpsUR0tEJKV8g0u\nkWMHKdPmREaFB+/8QSNM0HP