url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/8debbc167d89240303d9b764d98dc4cb3e6548ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:48:40Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:48:51Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"fix(velista): a walk no longer stops as the camera starts\n\nThe recording screen fed the tracking guard two things the walk lab never\nbelieved. The untracked poses a camera opens with counted as a loss, so a\ncamera slow to find its place stopped a new walk with no mark to resume\nfrom. Sensor timestamps went in raw, so a compass stamped on another clock\nread as seconds without a pose and stopped the walk at once.\n\nA session now starts at its first tracked pose, and both streams are\nstamped on the performance.now() clock, with a timestamp more than a second\nfrom now replaced by now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b92a4659ef4adf09dd0b80b12ca6196a92cb0f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/b92a4659ef4adf09dd0b80b12ca6196a92cb0f30"},"u