dmin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/071da49468b50af40d805e7c30933a88407f7cc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:23:38Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:23:38Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"feat(velista): price orders, a price history and the table of lists for a product (plan 0134)\n\nStage 2 of velista plan 0134, on the reads of backend plan 0196, with the\nowner''s decisions after the walk of stage 1.\n\n- The order menu offers Catalog order, Lowest price and Lowest price per\n  kilo or litre. A line \"Without a price\" stands before the first product\n  that has none.\n- The product page shows how the price has moved, as a stepped line for\n  each chain drawn in inline SVG, and the person''s lists with a stepper\n  for each line that holds the product.\n- The plus on a row stays a plus. Under the row sit the lines of the\n  chosen list that hold the product, each with its own stepper.\n- Deleting follows the server: write access is enough on a list that\n  approves lines by itself.\n- A failed read of the lists is said, with a second try, on the catalog,\n  in the sheet of lists and in the table of lists.\n- An add is drawn on the line it lands on. The server does not raise a\n  line at zero, so a stocked line of the same name is not that line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"252b2d0e023085beb489e137d8974f272de0ac78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/252b2d0e023085beb489e137d8974f272de0ac78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/