"name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"feat(luna): price orders, a shopper price history, and the lines that hold a product (plan 0196)\n\nWhat stage 2 of velista plan 0134 asks of the backend, and one rule the\nowner added after the walk of its stage 1.\n\n- GET /v1/catalog/items takes order=category, order=price and\n  order=unitPrice. All three page by keyset, and a product with no price\n  comes last in a price order.\n- GET /v1/catalog/items/:id/price-history answers what a shopper saw at\n  each scope over a range, by replaying the price rule of plan 0080 over\n  item_prices.\n- GET /v1/items/:id/list-lines answers every list the caller can read,\n  with the lines of each that hold the product.\n- DELETE /v1/lines/:id lets a writer delete an approved line on a list\n  that approves lines by itself.\n\nNo migration and no index. openapi.json and the admin wire types are\nregenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"462f47ea6526ea1dcce8d8bd1cfc118461659f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/462f47ea6526ea1dcce8d8bd1cfc118461659f68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/af949cf5ad62614eae2d2023a0c3927e9c912cec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/rece