ub.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/ca17e1d60bbd066b2e92fd10e65dabf7ae7926d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:16:19Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:16:19Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"fix(k8s): the catalog database is sized from its measured load in both clusters\n\nThe catalog sizing moves from the staging file to values.yaml, because the\ncatalog is the heavy instance in each cluster.\n\n- JIT off for the catalog database. One search statement cost 1.1 s of CPU\n  with JIT and 0.4 s with none.\n- 1Gi and 256MB of shared buffers. All tables but the audit log are 152 MB.\n- One core on staging, two on production.\n- Redis takes 500m on production. Its health probes used the whole 100m\n  period and stalled the server about 20 ms each time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b08c35e2819508c9921f69a4ab03e2360bf6aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/0b08c35e2819508c9921f69a4ab03e2360bf6aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/ca17e1d60bbd066b2e92fd10e65dabf7ae7926