mail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"fix(k8s): the staging catalog database gets a whole core and 1Gi\n\nEach Postgres pod was capped at 250m CPU and 256Mi. On staging a query\nthat needed 7.7 s of CPU took 31.2 s, throttled in 308 of 314 scheduler\nperiods, while the node sat 85% idle. The 349 MB catalog database did\nnot fit in its memory limit either.\n\n`postgres.instanceOverrides` lets one instance take its own resources,\nshared_buffers and work_mem, keyed by name. Staging sets it for the\ncatalog database only. Production renders exactly as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30c286f96630ea3790ba66b2558398ab175083c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/30c286f96630ea3790ba66b2558398ab175083c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/0aa8ad239875ab086e02312998c2a21095067a12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type