 what the line means by it\nagree: the same product group, or the same product set, or free text on both\nsides. Otherwise it creates a line beside the one that shares its name. The\nbatch add follows the same rule. A shopping list add goes through the same\nmethod, so it is covered too, and it meets a line that follows a group on the\nproducts alone, because it never names a group.\n\nA rename still asks the name alone. It asks a person before it merges.\n\nThe velista in-memory basket follows the server''s rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"758acbb04e429f24b7b3e3023de84d09f9495309","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/758acbb04e429f24b7b3e3023de84d09f9495309"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/51477a26e6bb2a3f3cb032d4b826cd46bb48d192","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ic