g filters\n\nThe pickers are pages of their own, so the catalog tab is destroyed while one is open and only what the URL holds comes back. The URL held the category, the chain and the shop. The search text and the order were signals on the tab and were always reset, and the category pages linked back with the category alone, which dropped the chain and the shop too.\n\nThe text and the order are now in the URL (q, order), written in place of the entry as they change. Both category pages and the supermarket picker hand every parameter they were not asked about back as they received it, also in their back fallbacks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f564b3b95f56afca219937c6b646b77efc319794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/f564b3b95f56afca219937c6b646b77efc319794"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/b35973ff34c91d636bcbf74f3154c7ae01ef59aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"