I/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/d485ab2459121a643e495a798d16b5891b474d41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:56:28Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:56:28Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"feat(luna-shopper-admin): a place says which shop it may be (plan 0061)\n\nThe places queue reads the candidates that the list read now carries\n(backend plan 0193). A line of the column carries a mark, the open place\nleads with the shops it may be, and a hint reads as a hint. \"Link to an\nexisting shop\" opens a shop picker over one chain, each shop of the\nnearby panel has its own link button, and a place that names another\nchain is asked about once before acrossChains is sent. After a link the\npage says which fields of the shop it filled.\n\nOne control in the header links the places that shops were made from. It\nshows the dry answer first, and apply is sent only by the button under\nthat preview.\n\nThe memory harvester works the candidates out with the rules of the\nbackend, answers the link with what it filled, refuses a place of\nanother chain, and links by reference dry and applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35e83cb59607891d48f92cc6b99cd6c6373df6fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/35e83cb59607891d48f92cc6b99cd6c6373df6fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/d485a