github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/c6b5c9724ca50594f8aa72dc6e2b2dda86f86a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:07:54Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:07:54Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"docs(catalog): the El Jamón shops get their addresses, and the dumps taken after (plan 0193)\n\nSection 4 of plan 0193 ran on slot 1 on 2026-10-07, after PR #659. One\nEl Jamón store discovery recorded 53 places. 19 of them were linked to the\n19 El Jamón shops, and 27 OpenStreetMap places were linked to their shop by\nreference. All 19 El Jamón shops hold an address, a city and a postal code\nnow. Nothing was imported or rejected. New final dumps were taken at 13:53\nMadrid time.\n\n- The restore manifest holds the two new checksums. Every count is the same.\n- The report of the first catalog holds the stage in a new section, and its\n  open points are up to date.\n- The decision register holds the rules, four new data files and the six\n  decisions that the stage left for the owner.\n- Plan 0193 records what its data step found, and the two numbers that\n  differ from what it expected.\n\nEden was not done. The registry cannot hold two brands with one label, so\nthe step waits for the owner to name the second label.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af8b2f8a055ecba34a85a04b83b9e99bb47f9899","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/af8b2f8a055ecba34a85a04b83b9e99bb47f9899"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/co