 walk and the dumps taken after them (plan 0192)\n\nTwo data stages changed slot 1 on 2026-10-07, after PR #656. The re-file\nmoved 2,250 products onto the leaves of plan 0179. The second curation walk\ncreated 2,430 products from queue rows that the first walk could not place.\nNew final dumps were taken at 12:28 Madrid time.\n\n- The restore manifest holds the checksums and the counts of those dumps.\n- The report of the first catalog holds both stages in a new section.\n- The decision register holds the rules, six new data files and the nine\n  decisions that the walk left for the owner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1255edf0ec5767489ebc7144e1021fa214c5e648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/1255edf0ec5767489ebc7144e1021fa214c5e648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/3effc6ba4fa0df97cfc27cdee0695804b23f9563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u