,"message":"docs(catalog): the coordinates of the tenth Deza shop, and the dumps taken after them (plan 0192)\n\nThe owner gave the coordinates of the Deza shop of code T7 on 2026-10-07,\nread from Google Maps. They were stored on slot 1 in one write through the\ngateway, and the final dumps were taken again at 2026-10-06T23:32:21Z\n(2026-10-07 01:32 Madrid time).\n\n- first-catalog.manifest: the two checksums and the header. The other\n  fourteen variables are the same.\n- The register: the fifth answer of 2026-10-07, a part for the write, and\n  c05 built again through build/stage-c.mjs, which now reads stage-c5/.\n- The report, the README of the import, k8s plan 0012 and plan 0192: the\n  new dumps, and the shop no longer stands in an open list.\n\nThe copy that the owner is checking on slot 0 is the restore of the dumps\nof 00:33. It differs from these dumps in the coordinates of this one shop\nand in one audit row. Nothing is uploaded, and the owner has not said that\nslot 1 is final.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a8a6fdcb2be1e413b3cf6b9186a26c2819468ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/1a8a6fdcb2be1e413b3cf6b9186a26c2819468ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/4729676c7369da71a7b7b9ce7a34cc1c83477e49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"htt