d for two more changes on slot 1: the Deza\ncode T7 got a shop that was created by hand, and the three shoe creams\nwent into the leaf shoe-care. New dumps were taken after them.\n\n- The manifest holds the values of the dumps of 2026-10-06T22:33:14Z:\n  the two checksums, and 105 price scopes.\n- The restore README, the register and the report state the new dumps\n  and the corrected counts.\n- The register build reads stage-c4 for c05 and c13. Every other data\n  file builds byte for byte as before.\n- loose-fruit-rows.md lists the loose fruit rows that wait for a fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8db71ceadd42c4923ff19b3abe42ce388ae59573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/8db71ceadd42c4923ff19b3abe42ce388ae59573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/3417b0f988aa5654d30f0ed34cc88e9b430d6b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","u