ommit/2b709b25502ef61164727a1c698bc5ccf374b591","sha":"2b709b25502ef61164727a1c698bc5ccf374b591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/2b709b25502ef61164727a1c698bc5ccf374b591"}],"sha":"af8c08f00de2801f32a73ca067813fbd0ae6b41b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/af8c08f00de2801f32a73ca067813fbd0ae6b41b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/2b709b25502ef61164727a1c698bc5ccf374b591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:38:06Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:38:06Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"fix(luna): a price keeps the kind of the source that stated it (plan 0190)\n\nA website and a leaflet of one chain can print one product with the same\nname and format, and they then share one row of source_catalog_entries. The\nrow had one sourceKind and each run wrote its own, so the text of the row and\nthe kind an accept wrote a price under depended on which run came last.\n\n- source_entry_prices.sourceKind: each price row says the kind of the run\n  that observed it. The unique key is (entryId, priceScopeId, sourceKind), so\n  a website price and a leaflet price for one scope are two rows.\n- An accept writes each price under its own kind, and compares it with the\n  prices of the same kind on the other bound rows of the chain.\n- A walk owns the text of a row. A leaflet that observes such a row moves the\n  seen fields and writes its prices, and leaves the source group alone. A\n  walk takes over a row that only a leaflet has described, once.\n- The settle of plan 0191 reads the kind from the price row, and asks the run\n  only for a price that has none.\n- The entry view carries the kind of each price, and the back office shows\n  it on each price line of the queue.\n\nMigration SourceEntryPriceKind1759200000000 adds the nullable column, stamps\neach existing price with the kind of its run, and swaps the key. It changes\nno price and deletes no row. A price whose kind cannot be read (no run, a run\nthat is gone, a run that does not say) stays without a kind.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99bb830c39e84c3ac9f20216f9003e8ad3191039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/99bb830c39e84c3ac9f20216f9003e8ad3191039"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/2b709b25502ef61164727a1c698bc5ccf374b591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com