"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/52a6e8a6aa6569f119912f1e5afa744495ed5729/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:38:23Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:38:23Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"docs(luna): plan 0191 names its pull request\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e00c98c20627727f4482cdee889aee5b30c4e4ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/e00c98c20627727f4482cdee889aee5b30c4e4ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/52a6e8a6aa6569f119912f1e5afa744495ed5729","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commit/52a6e8a6aa6569f119912f1e5afa744495ed5729","node_id":"C_kwDOOtjeeNoAKDUyYTZlOGE2YWE2NTY5ZjExOTkxMmYxZTVhZmE3NDQ0OTVlZDU3Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commit/5cb8bb796da3a720b6269f940520604302778325","sha":"5cb8bb796da3a720b6269f940520604302778325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/5cb8bb796da3a720b6269f940520604302778325"}],"sha":"52a6e8a6aa6569f119912f1e5afa744495ed5729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/52a6e8a6aa6569f119912f1e5afa744495ed5729"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63235844?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/5cb8bb796da3a720b6269f940520604302778325/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:37:48Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:37:48Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"fix(luna): a row that leaves a product takes its offers with it (plan 0191)\n\nA bound queue row that a person moved to another product, or rejected, left\non the old product everything it had written there: its price rows, an offer\nin every scope that fell through to them, its shop rows and its barcode.\nCatalog names no queue row on what it holds, so no later run took any of it\nback.\n\nSettle a product at a chain. One operation reads the rows of the chain that\nare bound to the product now and makes catalog agree with them. accept,\ncreateItem and reject call it for the product a row left, and\nPOST /v1/admin/harvest/items/:itemId/settle runs it for a person, with a dry\nrun that executes the same statements and rolls them back.\n\nCatalog owns the deletes, in two new messages for a service actor, audited\nlike deleteByRun. itemPrice.withdraw removes the price rows a run wrote for\na product at named scopes and kinds, and recomputes. supermarketItem.withdraw\nremoves the offers nothing prices, no shop row backs and no operator wrote,\nwith the shop rows a run wrote. A price or a row a person typed is never\nremoved.\n\nThe barcode moves with the row: it is taken off the old product and taught\nto the new one, unless another row bound to the old product prints it too.\n\nOne rule for two articles of one chain on one product at one scope, stated\nonce in source-entry-write.ts and read by the run and by the accept. Rows\nthat state two amounts send no price, in a run across its chunks and on an\naccept, and the answer names the rows. The entries of a product say which\nrows price the same scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86ca85072f442b9a997df4c96fc1c6521f8b3b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/86ca85072f442b9a997df4c96fc1c6521f8b3b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio