:"","html_url":"https://github.com/IchirokuXVI","id":63235844,"login":"IchirokuXVI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjM1ODQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IchirokuXVI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/commits/d2aa8d2fd24048ac502ad2fcc811e026e3c04ecb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:45:06Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:45:06Z","email":"danieliyo65@gmail.com","name":"Ichiroku"},"message":"docs(catalog): the owner''s answers to the sixteen decisions, and plan 0192\n\nThe owner answered the sixteen decisions of the first catalog repair on\n2026-10-06: fifteen decided, decision 9 held. The register states each\nanswer, adds rule R32 (a printed size wins over a size worked out from a\nunit price), and corrects the count of the links an agent made to five.\n\nThe build writes the answer as `ownerDecision` beside every `openDecision`\nof the data files (build/decisions.mjs). Nothing else in them changed.\n\nPlan 0192 applies ten of the answers on slot 1 in three stages, and says\nwhy it leaves six alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbfcfcf14a14fb84ad0c4151545bee040ba230b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/trees/bbfcfcf14a14fb84ad0c4151545bee040ba230b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IchirokuXVI/nx-portfolio/git/commits/d2aa8d2fd24048ac502ad2fcc811e026e3c04ecb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"veri