agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"message":"Improves modal close behavior and adds confirmation\n\nEnhances the modal component to prevent accidental data loss by introducing a confirmation dialog when closing with unsaved changes.\n\nClicking outside the modal, pressing the escape key, or pressing the cancel button now triggers a confirmation dialog if there''s unsaved progress, giving the user a chance to save or discard changes.\n\nAlso adds basic functionality to the \"Customer Info\" button in the order details.","tree":{"sha":"d008c70f194f7d736dc04c8b052a4304de5eba5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/trees/d008c70f194f7d736dc04c8b052a4304de5eba5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/commits/efe26fb7416c6d639915ecab41708543720e6f21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/efe26fb7416c6d639915ecab41708543720e6f21","node_id":"C_kwDOOvLsydoAKGVmZTI2ZmI3NDE2YzZkNjM5OTE1ZWNhYjQxNzA4NTQzNzIwZTZmMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24","sha":"4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24"}],"sha":"efe26fb7416c6d639915ecab41708543720e6f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/efe26fb7416c6d639915ecab41708543720e6f21"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:29:49Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:29:49Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"message":"Adds styling for status actions\n\nIntroduces a flexbox layout for status actions, ensuring consistent spacing between action buttons.","tree":{"sha":"50b6be660a4b51df50488c6ca7abba90204de798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/trees/50b6be660a4b51df50488c6ca7abba90204de798"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/commits/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24","node_id":"C_kwDOOvLsydoAKDRjYWRhYjM1NWM4NGZkZTA5ZjI0NWYxZjg2M2JhYTQwYjJkYWRhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411","sha":"9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411"}],"sha":"4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/4cadab355c84fde09f245f1f863baa40b2dada24"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:28:10Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:28:10Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"message":"Improves modal component and usage\n\nIntroduces a backdrop-less modal variant and simplifies modal triggering.\n\nThis change provides flexibility in how modals are displayed and\nstreamlines the logic for opening and closing them within the host\napplication.","tree":{"sha":"c9354ca750bd256bbc3f9213218be46b0f103023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/trees/c9354ca750bd256bbc3f9213218be46b0f103023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/commits/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411","node_id":"C_kwDOOvLsydoAKDkyMDBhNTYzMjNlYTBlZDUxNGU1MjY2NjU5M2EzOGVmNWM5MzU0MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commit/bf03184d10c179419dc6c460eb8af74120ee5dd2","sha":"bf03184d10c179419dc6c460eb8af74120ee5dd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/bf03184d10c179419dc6c460eb8af74120ee5dd2"}],"sha":"9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/9200a56323ea0ed514e52666593a38ef5c935411"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/commits/bf03184d10c179419dc6c460eb8af74120ee5dd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:01:14Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-27T12:01:14Z","email":"aryan_agarwal@apple.com","name":"Aryan Agarwal"},"message":"Removes unused title prop from Modal\n\nRemoves the `title` prop from the `Modal` component.\n\nThe `title` prop was not being used within the component, so it has been removed to simplify the component''s API and reduce potential confusion.","tree":{"sha":"48768f9d3aa7794df4f11a3c77133b7a87be104a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/trees/48768f9d3aa7794df4f11a3c77133b7a87be104a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aryankush25/module-federation-poc/git/commits/bf03184d10c179419dc6c460eb8af74120ee5dd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified