s and validation for installment plans\n\n- Added constants for maximum and minimum installment counts and plan amounts in constants.py.\n- Updated the InstallmentPlanCreateSerializer to include validation for total amount, installment count, and installment period.\n- Improved error messages for installment count validation to provide more informative feedback.\n- Enhanced PlanCreatorService to handle both single-customer and bulk installment creation with clear documentation and conflict checks.\n- Adjusted CustomerEmailValidator to return a single customer or None instead of an empty list.","tree":{"sha":"a449e749a10dc9d5ef42ae65aff530a10299986f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mojtaba-arvin/django-react-iou-bnpl/git/trees/a449e749a10dc9d5ef42ae65aff530a10299986f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mojtaba-arvin/django-react-iou-bnpl/git/commits/edaa0edc94ff40f8d01c8dd98dd962e7fe65cec5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6056661?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mojtaba-arvin","id":6056661,"login":"mojtaba-arvin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTY2NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin","user_vi