":"m.arvin@live.com","name":"Mojtaba Arvin"},"message":"feat(installment): add ''all'' filter option, update serializers for payment eligibility and improve retrieval logic\n\n- Added ''all'' filter to `InstallmentStatusFilters` for handling all installments.\n- Enhanced `CustomerFacingInstallmentSerializer` to include payment eligibility (`is_payable`) field.\n- Updated `InstallmentRetrievalService` to annotate installments with `is_payable`, considering active plan status and unpaid previous installments.\n- Modified `bulk_create_installments` to ensure rounding is consistent when splitting total amount across installments.\n- Updated test cases in `test_bulk_create_installments.py` to reflect changes in installment amount distribution.","tree":{"sha":"cce3d52f0dfc4c4b1cdab649834f4dccf6ef2e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mojtaba-arvin/django-react-iou-bnpl/git/trees/cce3d52f0dfc4c4b1cdab649834f4dccf6ef2e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mojtaba-arvin/django-react-iou-bnpl/git/commits/4be9b1fbc535221db5bc00ffb7f34b2b2a991350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6056661?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mojtaba-arvin","id":6056661,"login":"mojtaba-arvin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTY2NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mojtaba-arvin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su